182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (ACP takes a workflow-oriented approach, providing REST-based conventions for task delegation, stateful sessions, and orchestration across multi-agent systems. Although ACP has since merged its efforts with A2A under the Linux Foundation umbrella, its contributions to stateful session management and observability remain influential in the combined specification.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
