/P 97 0 R
/E (The recent addition of OAuth 2.0 authentication addresses who can connect, but not who can see the data once connected. The MCP specification itself acknowledges this gap, stating that security enforcement happens above the protocol level, not within it.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
